  "verseCount": 24,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "46",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "EZK 46"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "46",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\" 'Ma e gima Jehova Nyasaye Manyalo Gik Moko Duto wacho: Rangach mar laru maiye mochomo yo wuok chiengʼ nyaka sik kolor kuom ndalo auchiel mitiye, to chiengʼ Sabato kod chiengʼ Dwe Mowuok Manyien nyaka yawe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ruoth marito piny nyaka wuog e laru oko midhiyo e ot maduongʼ manie dhorangach ma yo wuok chiengʼ mi ochungʼ e bath sirni mag dhorangajno. E kindeno jodolo notimne misengini miwangʼo pep kod mag lalruok. Nyaka olam Nyasaye kochungʼ e bath siro mar rangach eka owuog odhi oko, to rangach nyaka sik koyaw nyaka piny imre.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndalo mag Sabato kod Dwe Mowuok Manyien, jopinyno nyaka lem e nyim Jehova Nyasaye gie dhorangach midonjogo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Misango miwangʼo pep ma ruodh piny okelo ni Jehova Nyasaye chiengʼ Sabato nyaka bed nyirombe auchiel kod im achiel maonge songa kargi ariyogo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chiwo mar cham michiwo kaachiel gi im nyaka rom debe achiel, to chiwo mar cham michiwo kaachiel gi nyirombe to ngʼato nyalo chiwo kaka osengʼado e chunye, kaachiel gi kube achiel mar mo kuom debe ka debe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E odiechiengʼ mar Dwe Mowuok Manyien, nyaka ochiw nyarwath gi nyirombe auchiel kod im, maonge songa kargi duto.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyaka ochiw chiwo mar cham debe achiel kaachiel gi rwath michiwego, kod debe achiel machielo gi im, to kuom nyarombo ka nyarombo onyalo kelo cham mangʼeny kaka en owuon ema ohero. Kuom debe ka debe mar cham, to onyalo kelo mo zeituni moromo lita angʼwen.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka ruodh piny donjo to nyaka odonji gie agola mar rangach, kendo kowuok to nyaka owuog koluwo kanyono.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\" 'Ka jopinyno obiro e nyim Jehova Nyasaye e kinde mag sewni moyier, ngʼato angʼata modonjo koluwo rangach man yo nyandwat mondo olem nyaka wuog koluwo rangach man yo milambo; to ngʼato angʼata modonjo gi rangach ma yo milambo nyaka wuogi gi rangach ma yo nyandwat. Ok oyiene ngʼato angʼata dok koluwo rangach mane odonjogo, to ngʼato ka ngʼato nyaka wuog oko koluwo rangach mangʼiyore gi mano mane odonjogo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ruodh pinyno nyaka tim kaka ji duto mamoko timo; nyaka odonji ka gidonjo kendo owuogi kagiwuok.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\" 'E sawo ka sawo kod nyasi ka nyasi moyiedhi, chiwo mar cham nyaka bed debe achiel gi rwath, debe achiel gi im, to kuom nyirombe, ngʼato nyalo chiwo kaka osengʼado e chunye, kaachiel gi kube achiel mar mo kuom debe ka debe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\" 'Ka ruodh pinyno kelo chiwo mar hera ni Jehova Nyasaye, obed misango miwangʼo pep kata chiwo mar lalruok, to nyaka yawne rangach mochomo yo wuok chiengʼ. Enochiw misangone miwangʼo pepno kata chiwo mage mag lalruok mana kaka ojatimo chiengʼ Sabato. Eka enowuog odhi oko, kendo kosewuok odhi oko, to nolor rangach.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\" 'Pile ka pile nyaka uchiw ni Jehova Nyasaye nyaim ma hike achiel maonge songa kaka misango miwangʼo pep; nyaka uchiwe okinyi kokinyi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bende nyaka uchiw chiwo mag cham kaachiel kode okinyi kokinyi, maromo achiel ewi auchiel mar debe kod mo maromo achiel kuom adek mar okebe, mar dwalo mogo. Chik mar chiwo mar chamni ne Jehova Nyasaye en chik mochwere.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kamano e kaka nyarombo gi chiwo mar cham kod mo ibiro chiwo okinyi kokinyi seche duto michiwoe misango miwangʼo pep.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\" 'Ma e gima Jehova Nyasaye Manyalo Gik Moko Duto wacho: Ka ruodh pinyno ogolo mich moro kuom girkeni mare momiyo achiel kuom yawuote, to michno nobed girkeni mar nyikwaye bende, kaka girkeni margi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To ka dipo ni ochiwo mich kuom girkeni mare ne achiel kuom jotichne, to jatichneno nyalo rite nyaka chop higa mar weye thuolo; bangʼ mano michno nyaka dwoki ni ruodh pinyno. Girkeni mar ruodh pinyno en mar yawuote kende; en pokgi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ruodh pinyno ok oyiene kawo girkeni moro amora mar ji, komayogi mwandugi. Ruodhno nyaka pog yawuote maa mwandune owuon kaka girkeni mondo omi kik ngʼata moro amora opogi gi mwandune.' \"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eka ngʼatno nokela kakalo koda kar donjo man e dir rangach midonjogo e ute maler mowal mochomo nyandwat, mane gin mag jodolo, kendo nonyisa kamoro mane nitie yo ka tungʼ mogik mare.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nowachona niya, \"Ka e kama jodolo biro chiwoe misango mar pwodhruok e ketho gi misango mar golo richo kendo ma gibiro tedoe chiwo mar cham, mondo ogengʼ-gi kik gibi e laru ma oko mi gimi ji dok mogak.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bangʼe ne okela nyaka e laru ma oko kendo notelona kolworo koda kondene angʼwen, mi naneno ei kona ka kona laru machielo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ei konde angʼwen mag laru ma oko ne nitie laru ma oko mopondo, ma borgi noromo fut piero auchiel, to lachgi oromo fut piero angʼwen gabich. Laru ka laru mane ni e ii konde angʼwen-go ne romre.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gie ii moro ka moro mar laru angʼwen-go ne nitie ndiri mar kidi, ma bwoye piny ne ogerie kuonde mikudhe mach e alwora duto.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nowachona niya, \"Magi e kuonde tedo ma joma tiyo e hekalu biro tedoe misengini mag ji.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
